--- !u!114 &6951074393003031438
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2882430653163996545}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 47ee70bafc6274743bfa78d2dcf9d942, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textField: {fileID: 4560533999035160625}
  textSpeed: 38
  lines:
  - 'Brothers and sisters of the night! '
  - 'Tonight! we rise, not from graves or coffins, but for our rights! '
  - Without us, Dracula would be just a weird old guy in a disheveled old tower.
  - 'We demand fair livable wages! '
  - 'We demand safe working conditions. '
  - 'Why are there even so many spikes and hazards everywhere. '
  - 'It makes it almost impossible to get around. '
  - So tonight, we do not bow. Tonight, we do not cower. Tonight we stand together.
  endLine: They're here!!! Everyone SCRAM!
